    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:1200px"><div class="wp-block-cover aligncenter"><img src="/images/Food-Factory1-1024x456.jpg" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="456" class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-299 size-large" alt="food materials processing line" style="object-position:55% 85%" title="China Potato Products Supplier 1" /><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-20 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow"><h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size"><strong>Global Manufacturer of Premium Potato-Based Ingredients</strong></h1><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>Specializing in Potato Flakes, Starches, Flours, and Frozen Fries</em></p></div></div></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:100%"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><mark style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: #098b4d;" class="has-inline-color"><strong>High-quality Potato Flakes, French Fries, Starch Manufacturer and Supplier</strong></mark></h2></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field.jpg" decoding="async" width="893" height="192" alt="potato materials field" class="wp-image-319" style="aspect-ratio:4.651110486364915;width:1120px;height:auto" title="China Potato Products Supplier 2" /></figure></div></div></div><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size" id="h-our-advantages">OUR ADVANTAGES</h2><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Location &amp; Raw Material</strong></td><td>Located in Hebei, China: Positioned within the <strong>41° N latitude Potato Growing Zone</strong>, offering a climate and vast geographical area ideal for superior potato cultivation. Proximity to major high-quality potato planting bases and key export ports.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Technical Advantage</strong></td><td>Expertise in Potato Deep Processing: Led by top Chinese food industry experts specializing in potato ingredient functional development and process engineering. We utilize the <strong>most advanced production lines</strong> to guarantee product processing quality and consistency.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Quality &amp; Compliance</strong></td><td><strong>Comprehensive Certifications:</strong> We hold complete product qualification and safety systems, including <strong>ISO, HACCP, BRC, Halal</strong>, etc., ensuring global regulatory compliance. We maintain <strong>excellent production workers and food engineers</strong>, supported by <strong>perfect testing equipment and laboratories</strong> to guarantee stable and superior product quality.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Supply Chain &amp; Capacity</strong></td><td><strong>Abundant Capacity:</strong> Our sufficient and stable production capacity can meet the diverse requirements of large international buyers and procurement orders.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Service &amp; Partnership</strong></td><td>Proficient English Communication &amp; Flexible OEM: Comprehensive support for global clients, including private label customization for potato flakes and fries.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Client Endorsement</strong></td><td>Clients include well-known global brands (Pepsi China, Orion, Dali, Unify Thailand). Stable quality and timely supply are proven.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-1" id="h-food-materials-product-range" style="color:#26a906;text-transform:uppercase">Our Core Potato Products Portfolio</h2></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Potato Flakes</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-Potato-flakes-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1329" title="China Potato Products Supplier 3" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">From standard to high-grade varieties, our potato flakes are designed to meet diverse industry needs.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">Backed by <strong>FSSC certification</strong>, we have a strong global export track record.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">We specialize in <strong>OEM solutions</strong>, allowing us to customize specifications to your exact requirements.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Frozen French Fries</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-french-fries.jpg" decoding="async" width="632" height="632" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1331" title="China Potato Products Supplier 4" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">Our ISO-certified facility produces high-quality frozen French fries available in <strong>various cuts and sizes</strong>.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">We pride ourselves on flexibility, offering <strong>bespoke OEM services</strong> to align perfectly with your brand and customer preferences.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>Potato Starch</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/potato-starch-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1246" title="China Potato Products Supplier 5" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">Engineered for versatility, our potato starch is a <strong>Grade A product</strong> produced in strict accordance with Chinese National Standards.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">Its superior quality makes it the ideal choice for applications across multiple sectors, ensuring consistency and performance.</p></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field1-1024x168.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="168" alt="Food materials | raw potatoes" class="wp-image-315" style="width:1200px" title="China Potato Products Supplier 6" /></figure></div></div></div><p class="has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph"> Please Feel Free to contact us</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>Address:</strong>&nbsp;#3, building North Silicon Valley, Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou City, China.</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>Phone | WhatsApp | WeChat:</strong>&nbsp;+86 13323237275</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>Email:&nbsp;</strong><a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></p><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Chinese Site</strong>: <a href="https://www.dinweys.cn/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">dinweys.cn</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>`} />
